43:["$","p",null,{"children":["are not store implementations. Both are thin constructors that return an\n",["$","code",null,{"children":"S3Store"}],". Cloudflare R2 and OCI object storage are S3-compatible, and\nForge treats them as exactly that. If you are chasing a bug in R2\nbehaviour, the code you want is in ",["$","code",null,{"children":"s3_store.rs"}],"."]}]
44:["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","code",null,{"children":"RefStore"}]," is the other oddity: it resolves its target by name at\n",["$","code",null,{"children":"post_init"}],", holding a weak reference to the store manager, using\n",["$","code",null,{"children":"UnsafeCell"}]," with a hand-written ",["$","code",null,{"children":"Sync"}]," impl. It is the mechanism that lets\none store be named by several others without duplicating it, and it is why\n",["$","$L4d",null,{"href":"/explanations/architecture-deep-dive#stores-are-built-in-two-phases","children":"store construction happens in two phases"}],"."]}]
45:["$","div",null,{"className":"my-6 flex gap-3 rounded-xl border px-5 py-4 border-amber-500/40 bg-amber-50/60 text-foreground dark:bg-amber-500/10","role":"alert","children":[["$","svg",null,{"width":"20","height":"20","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"1.75","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400","aria-hidden":"true","children":"$30:props:children:0:props:children"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"flex-1 [&>p]:my-0 [&>p+p]:mt-2","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-1 font-mono text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em]","children":"A filesystem existence check can have a side effect"}],["$","p",null,{"children":["When ",["$","code",null,{"children":"FilesystemStore::has_with_results"}]," is asked about the empty blob (the\ndigest of zero bytes) and that entry is not on disk yet, it creates the\nzero-byte file as a side effect of what reads, from its name, like a pure\nquery. Anything counting inodes or watching the content directory should\nexpect an entry that no upload produced."]}]]}]]}]
